<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Maximus Inc prices at $16.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Maximus Inc prices at $16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			  Maximus Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $15 - $16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			5,250,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed symbol, estimated price range and proposed number of shares were modified for the planned initial public offering in Maximus Inc.</p>
<p>The proposed symbol was altered to &quot;MMS&quot; on the New York Stock Exchange from &quot;MXMS&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market; the estimated price range was raised to $15 to $16 from $13 to $15 previously and the proposed number of shares increased to 5.25 million shares from an initial 4.4 million shares.</p>
</text>
